Official AISIX 1.9.0 ARM64 container, pinned by immutable image digest. Configuration and provider resources are mounted read-only. The gateway and mock use the same host network, with the gateway constrained to the standard four-core slice.

One static resource configuration wires the mock-backed OpenAI Chat, OpenAI Responses and Anthropic models. Fresh correctness probes establish the served pairs for this build; historical declarations from AISIX 0.10 are not reused as current evidence.
